highOrderElectroActivationFoamImplicitPETScDistributed.C

/* Added for cardiacFoam.

   Two copies exist on purpose, mirroring the MMS solver:

     ...Parallel     the LRE -> movingLeastSquares port, plus global matrix
                     columns. Serial-only linear algebra (Eigen, PETSC_COMM_SELF).
                     Frozen: it is the VERIFIED baseline, reproducing the
                     pre-port archive to machine precision and R1 exactly.

     ...Distributed  this one. Adds distributed linear algebra and the parallel
                     correctness fixes on top. Every stage here is checked bit
                     for bit against ...Parallel's R1 on one rank before its
                     parallel behaviour is exercised, which is only possible
                     because the frozen copy still exists. */
EXE = $(FOAM_USER_APPBIN)/highOrderElectroActivationFoamImplicitPETScDistributed
